## 15. Definition of Done

- [ ] Demo user (`demo@spendly.com` / `demo123`) can log in and lands on `/profile`.
- [ ] Wrong password / unknown email both show the same generic message.
- [ ] Empty email or password shows the field-specific message.
- [ ] Missing/tampered CSRF token on `POST /login` is rejected.
- [ ] Successful login sets a session cookie that is `HttpOnly`, `SameSite=Lax`.
- [ ] Visiting `/profile` or any `/expenses/...` route while logged out redirects to `/login`.
- [ ] `/logout` clears the session and visiting `/profile` afterward redirects to `/login` again.
- [ ] Nav shows "Sign in"/"Get started" when logged out, name + "Log out" when logged in.
- [ ] `app.py` starts cleanly; existing routes (`/`, `/register`, `/terms`, `/privacy`) unaffected.
